{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion as an alternative to concatenation fusion in a multimodal singleprofile model, using PCA-reduced RNA data and ResNet50 image features. Validation accuracy (0.5232) and F1 (0.5084) were slightly lower than the baseline concat fusion (0.5266, 0.5104), suggesting no clear performance improvement from weighted fusion. The effectiveness of modality interaction remains uncertain without further comparative benchmarks."
}

